  "contentHtml": "\n<div><br><div><a href=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-tH8XdU4CWAw/TXpxP1SoRQI/AAAAAAAAAcs/PbFeySXkEMk/s1600/Japan+Earthquake.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120313041303im_/https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-tH8XdU4CWAw/TXpxP1SoRQI/AAAAAAAAAcs/PbFeySXkEMk/s1600/Japan+Earthquake.png\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div>Япон улсад эмгэнэл илэрхийлж байна. Хайран сайхан орон. Хүмүүн төрлөхтөн бид байгаль усаа хамгаалж хайрлаагүй болохоор биднийг шийтгэж байна. Хэзээ ч бидний ээлж ирж болзошгүй. Та бүхэнд 11-ны өдрийн гашуун өдрийн зургуудыг хүргэж байна. Бурхан ивээх болтугай. Энэ бүхэн хурдан дуусаасай.<br><div><a href=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-6zM88fexsCI/TXpxbOTBNBI/AAAAAAAAAcw/GPstnBucXeY/s1600/Japan+Tsunami+Cars.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120313041303im_/https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-6zM88fexsCI/TXpxbOTBNBI/AAAAAAAAAcw/GPstnBucXeY/s400/Japan+Tsunami+Cars.png\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></div><br><div><span><a href=\"http://www.blogger.com/goog_1386241141\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120313041303im_/http://l.yimg.com/ea/img/-/110311/13nn_16njrcp-16njrdn.jpg?x=400&amp;q=80&amp;n=1&amp;sig=dWPmm9a9m0ndoLbyAM6bSA--\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></span></div><br><div><span><a href=\"http://www.blogger.com/goog_1386241141\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120313041303im_/http://sfist.com/upload/2011/03/Japan%20Earthquake_chun15.jpg\" border=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a></span></div><br><div><a href=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-FHkDgNJQn0Q/TXpxHfwl7nI/AAAAAAAAAco/d-CVvq1yp10/s1600/Japan+Tsunami+Pic.png\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120313041303im_/https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-FHkDgNJQn0Q/TXpxHfwl7nI/AAAAAAAAAco/d-CVvq1yp10/s400/Japan+Tsunami+Pic.png\" border=\"0\